  "contentHtml": "\n                      推しがげんきで<br>&nbsp;<br>きょうもごはんがおいしい<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>ども。ポカです。<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>今日のブログでいいたいことは<br>&nbsp;<br>たったひとつです<br>&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;<img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br><br><img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br><br>・<br>・<br>・<br>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;こんしゅうのマガジンますとチェックで～<br>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br>&nbsp;<br>ちなみに、<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>「大切な人と手を繋いで渡ると願いが叶うらしい」です<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>現場からはいじょうです<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>ではまた～<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>ポカ\n                    ",
  "contentHtmlFurigana": "\n                      <ruby>推<rt>お</rt></ruby>しがげんきで<br>&nbsp;<br>きょうもごはんがおいしい<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>ども。ポカです。<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br><ruby>今日<rt>きょう</rt></ruby>のブログでいいたいことは<br>&nbsp;<br>たったひとつです<br>&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;<img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br><br><img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br><br>・<br>・<br>・<br>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;こんしゅうのマガジンますとチェックで～<br>&nbsp;<br><img src=\"/images/blogs/poka/2022-10-19/45890_4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1479\" height=\"1109\"><br>&nbsp;<br>ちなみに、<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>「<ruby>大切<rt>たいせつ</rt></ruby>な<ruby>人<rt>ひと</rt></ruby>と<ruby>手<rt>て</rt></ruby>を<ruby>繋<rt>つな</rt></ruby>いで<ruby>渡<rt>わた</rt></ruby>ると<ruby>願<rt>ねが</rt></ruby>いが<ruby>叶<rt>かな</rt></ruby>うらしい」です<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br><ruby>現場<rt>げんば</rt></ruby>からはいじょうです<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>ではまた～<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>ポカ\n                    ",
